# Figma Integration Workflow

## Figma Design System Integration Checklist

### 1. Figma Setup
- **Figma File Access**: Get Figma file URL or shared access
- **Design Tokens**: Extract colors, typography, spacing, components
- **Component Library**: Identify reusable components
- **Design System**: Create consistent theme based on Figma

